        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by a Pokémon. It’s a sumptuous\nscarf that boosts the power of Normal-type moves.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "はだざわりの　よい　スカーフ。\n持たせると　ノーマルタイプの\n技の　威力が　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "手感不错的围巾。\n携带后，一般属性的\n招式威力就会提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "La delicadeza del pañuelo fortalece los movimientos de\ntipo Normal. Debe llevarlo un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
